{"batchcomplete":true,"query":{"pages":[{"pageid":1124580,"ns":0,"title":"Bathtub curve","extract":"In reliability engineering and deterioration modeling, a bathtub curve is a failure rate graph that curves up at both ends, similar in shape to a bathtub. The term can also apply to any graph with this shape.","description":"Curve for failure rates over time","descriptionsource":"local"}]}}